{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1476981-information-as-the-5th-state-of-matter","id":1476981,"title":"Information as the 5th state of Matter","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-03-22T10:36:39-07:00","id":1476981,"title":"Information as the 5th state of Matter","content":"In 2019 somebody proposed that information (data) has mass and is a state of matter. Now a physicist has proposed an experiment to test if this is true.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.sci-news.com/physics/information-fifth-state-matter-10638.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://cdn.sci.news/images/2022/03/image_10638f-Information.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.sci-news.com/physics/information-fifth-state-matter-10638.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Newly Proposed Experiment Could Confirm that Information is Fifth State of Matter | Sci.News </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.sci-news.com/physics/information-fifth-state-matter-10638.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.sci-news.com/physics/information-fifth-state-matter-10638.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Dr. Melvin Vopson has designed an experiment -- which if proved correct -- means he will have discovered that information is the fifth form of matter. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> If this was demonstrated experimentally in the WoD, whose paradigm would benefit the most? Would it help the Virtual Adepts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-22T11:40:36-07:00","id":1476990,"title":"","content":"I think it could inspire very cool cross-Tradition between VA and Etherites, not to mention fringe VA concepts with the Matter Sphere.<br /> Also for NWO/Iteration X projects<br /> <br /> Other that that. No idea. I think the implications fly above my limited understanding about science. Some tougths:<br /> <br /> *VA definitely think about Information as it's own thing, it's own 10th Sphere even ... but a &quot;material&quot;?. I can see camps forming arround that topic.<br /> <br /> *Conversely NWO has the idea that reality it's defined by propaganda and social discouse. Now your propaganda has measurable &quot;weight&quot;?<br /> <br /> I see these two - the users of Data Sphere, for those that use alternate spheres - as being the ones that stand to gain the most. After that, Etherites and ItXers for their expertice with matter and energy<br /> <br /> *Correspondence/Data it's now a<i> Pattern Sphere</i> :P ?... well, obviously not because this is a game and as such isn't subject to revision by the scientific comunity :P But maybe I could see the interest to draw some paralels there for some fringe Effects<br /> <br /> *It seems a bit too abstract and out there to change the Consensus in a significative fashion. Like with the Higgs Boson discovery, I see some potential fuel for the scy-fy elements of the game but I don't see the setting changing much. <i>Unlike </i>with the Quantum thing, whose pop-culture takes about multiple universes and cats gave us countless scy-fy stories and jokes. But I may be wrong<br /> <br /> *Mages are soupposed to - more often than not - know about scientific discoveries before they're publicized. Obviously Mage: The Ascencion can't keep up, but I think saying mages were working on this for decades it's perfectly kosher.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 03-22-2022, 02:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-22T11:42:11-07:00","id":1476991,"title":"","content":"I'm definitely for spending money on particle accelerators. My thoughts on who it would benefit most... Part of the Hubris of the Ascension War is the idea that once you change reality to suit your vision, you win. When you push to add some part of your Magical Paradigm to the Consensus, you necessarily share the potential benefits with everyone else. I made a post about The Syndicate <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1421925-warding-stock-exchanges-prognostication-counter-strategies\">Warding Stock Exchanges</a> to prevent other Mages from Magically predicting stocks. It was pointed out that even if they warded the exchanges themselves, they could not prevent scrying to predict individual stocks being traded across the whole of the internet. <br /> <br /> This means, despite the High Guild having worked diligently to establish stock markets as part of Earthly Reality, they have no particular advantage over any other Mage with Entropy 1 and Time 2. Any character who invests just half their allotted points in Spheres can select from a list of stocks the best one to buy in the near future and then determine the best precise times to buy and sell it. The only way the Syndicate could enforce control over global wealth is by finding and coercing other awakened traders into joining, using the Enforcement Methodology, of course.<br /> <br /> If an experiment establishes into the Consensus that information is a fifth state of matter and the Virtual Adepts are behind said experiment, they are likely to be positioned to benefit most in the short term, but the advantage wouldn't last very long. They could use that short term advantage to conjure something from the Digital Web into the world or something similar. Iteration-X and the Heralds of Basilisk would soon adapt. Even the least scientific Mages could try to use the principle as a basis for all kinds of effects, with a bit of study or the Dream Background.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-22T14:26:38-07:00","id":1477021,"title":"","content":"Calling information a state of matter feels more like sensational science journalism than actually paying attention to the physics being discussed.<br /> <br /> This doesn't really change anything. Information can be stored in Matter Patterns... we've known that for tens of thousands of years. The information being discussed as the &quot;5th&quot; state of matter here is, by the scientist that design the experiment in question, kinda like DNA: it's an encoding of the function of the matter within the matter. So... you can scan subatomic particles to know what they do. I'm pretty sure Matter or Forces already had that covered for techno-mages. As noted, even if the experiment proves the information conjectures, it doesn't actually change anything about physics. It just means a certain amount of mass in subatomic particles is dedicated to dictating the different functions of subatomic particles on themselves.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}